<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., the date the particular text of a work was written or revised, the date a song was performed, etc. The date may be a single date or a range of dates. In the absence of an ascertainable date of expression, the date of the expression may be associated with the date of its publication or release."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3010> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/C1002> .
