<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3068> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression that is a musical notation or recorded sound to the instrumental and, or, vocal medium of performance of a musical work represented in the expression. The instruments and, or, voices represented in a particular expression of a work may differ from the medium of performance for which the work was originally intended."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3068> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "tiene medio de interpretaciÃ³n (notaciÃ³n musical o registro sonoro)"@es .
