<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3042> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a person to a numeral, word, or abbreviation indicating succession within a family or dynasty, or an epithet or other word or phrase associated with the person."@en .
