<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P2097> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression of a prior work to another work that is intended to be used in conjunction with the prior work. The content may be closely or loosely associated, so the supplementary work may be referential or autonomous with respect to the prior work."@en .
