<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A manifestation may be associated with one or more publishers or distributors."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3056> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a manifestation to the individual, group, or organization named in the manifestation as being responsible for the publication, distribution, issuing, or release of the manifestation."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3056> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/C1003> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3035> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "E.g., missing pages, plates, etc. Condition may reflect other aspects of the physical condition of the item as well (e.g., brittleness, faded images, etc.)."@en .
