<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P2063> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates an expression to another expression of the same work that represents a literal translation, in which the intent is to render the intellectual content of the previous expression as accurately as possible."@en .
