<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P2008> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a corporate body to a work of which it is responsible for the creation of the intellectual or artistic content."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/C1010> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The entity defined as place encompasses a comprehensive range of locations: terrestrial and extra-terrestrial; historical and contemporary; geographic features and geo-political jurisdictions. For the purposes of this model places are treated as entities only to the extent that they are the subject of a work (e.g., the subject of a map or atlas, or of a travel guide, etc.)."@en .
