<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/C1005> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The entity defined as person encompasses individuals that are deceased as well as those that are living. For the purposes of this model persons are treated as entities only to the extent that they are involved in the creation or realization of a work (e.g., as authors, composers, artists, editors, translators, directors, performers, etc.), or are the subject of a work (e.g., as the subject of a biographical or autobiographical work, of a history, etc.)."@en .
