<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P3020> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "There may be one or more titles associated with a manifestation. Titles associated with a manifestation include all those that appear in the manifestation itself (e.g., the title on the title page, title frame, etc., a cover title, added title-page title, caption title, running title, spine title, etc., the title in a colophon, explicit, etc., the title on a container, on a microfiche header, etc.), as well as those that have been assigned to the manifestation for purposes of bibliographic control (e.g., key title, expanded title, translated title, supplied title, etc.)."@en .
