<http://iflastandards.info/ns/fr/frbr/frbrer/P2106> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a work to an expression of a prior work of which it represents a transformation of the content in a different genre. The modification of the content of the prior work must be sufficient in degree to warrant the adaptation work being considered as a new work autonomous with respect to the prior work."@en .
